// =====================================================================
//  RuntimeNVSIndirectDraw.nsl — NorthstarRuntime Internal Compute
//  Northstar Virtual Shadows (NVS)
//  GPU-Driven Indirect Draw Command Generation, Reflected Per-Draw CBV &
//  Per-Batch Instance SRV Population, PSO Group Routing & Page Commit
// =====================================================================

STAGE COMPUTE

